.000000Z"},{"id":5293643,"review":"جميلة جدا ومرحبة بشكل لا يصدق ونظيفة كانت تجربة جميلة ومريحة 🤍 أنا ممتن لهم بصراحة أوصيكم جدا بها","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5315267,"review":"Great","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5339144,"review":"The flat is very clean and the erea is calm and quite every thing went well but grocery is little bit far","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5354756,"review":"Thanks and will be back…","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5374071,"review":"It was nice place, clean and Very quiet\nThanks for everything.","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:33.000000Z"},{"id":5414082,"review":"مكان حميل جدا ونظيف وراقي وانصح فيه وبشدة وسوفه اعود اليه بذن الله","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5426520,"review":"really nice experience!","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5432632,"review":"The apartment was spotless, truly a haven of cleanliness and comfort. Every detail was carefully attended to, making the stay incredibly pleasant. It was a truly outstanding experience, and I would highly recommend it to anyone seeking a perfect place to stay.\nAnd I also would thank Yousef family for the outstanding support. They are the best Wallah ✨✨✨✨.","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5442334,"review":"مسكن رائع","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5451183,"review":"Positive:\nI like everything\n\nNegative:\n5-6 Dogs in the compound were scary and disturbing and 1st floor dog in the apartment was barking a lot.","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5473729,"review":"المكان كموقع حلو . واسعه فيها غرفتين . العيب الوحيد اللي واجهته هو فرش السرير والمفارش. قديمة شوي اتمنى من المالك الاهتمام وتغييرها","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5478936,"review":"The apartment is located within Marriage Gardens, a really safe and peaceful building. The interior decoration is pretty much in line with the pictures. It's quite spacious, bright, and beautiful, and the facilities are basically complete.\nThe service they provided was extremely prompt and attentive. Whenever there were issues during my stay, professional staff patiently resolved them. When I was checking in, there was a problem with the location positioning. According to the address description they provided, Google Maps directed me to a different place. I don't think this was their fault. It was probably due to version differences caused by the fact that my phone couldn't install Google Play. Eventually, I managed to check in after solving the problem over the phone. I really appreciate their earnest service attitude.","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:53.000000Z"},{"id":5516693,"review":"We stayed in Xurus 2 bedroom lavish apartment in new Cairo, they were very informative and helpful when it came to anything we needed. \n\nGood location to areas local to new Cairo and only 30-40 min journey to Central Cairo.\n\nThe place was nice and had all the amenities you’d need to relax!","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:56.000000Z"},{"id":5543355,"review":"Sure! Here's a polished review you can use:\n\n\n---\n\nI had a great stay at this apartment! The location is excellent—very convenient and close to the airport, which made traveling super easy. Communication was outstanding; the host was incredibly responsive and always replied within a few minutes. The apartment itself was exactly as described and matched the photos perfectly—clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. I’d definitely recommend this place for a short-term stay and would gladly book again!","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5579170,"review":"Vraiment horrible mon séjour, au dessus de moi il y avait un grand chantier bruit le matin et surtout beaucoup de poussière des travaux qui entrée dans l’appart. Si j’avais pas eu mon travail qui été à côté de l’appart j’aurai déjà quitter et le hote me répondais plus quand je lui ai dit tout ça j’avais répondu à son message mais après plus de nouvelle seulement que la veille de départ pour me dire l’heure à la quelle je dois quitter l’appartement","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5588228,"review":"المكان جميل وواسع جدا ، النظافة 10/10 ولا يوجد روائح وهذ شي ايجابي ، اول تجرب وبطبع لن تكون الاخيرة","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":6143740,"review":"الموقع رائع وافضل شئ حارس العقار خدوم جدا ومحترم ودائما متواجد","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6148552,"review":"The gaurd and his wife were amazingly helpful, very sweet people made the stay much better, was disappointed that the pictures showed an amazing pool and we were not allowed to use it and it was the main reason we booked there so kindly remove that picture as it gives a misunderstanding","rental_id":226095,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}